  # 6 cluster(s), 20 cores as the die is built:
  #   cluster 0: 2 x E-core
  #   cluster 1: 4 x P-core
  #   cluster 2: 4 x P-core
  #   cluster 8: 2 x E-core
  #   cluster 9: 4 x P-core
  #   cluster 10: 4 x P-core
  #
